9|0=2|4|17|9|101|0|6|<s_1.3>Rules for *BitbAem*!<s_1>\n\n1. @No Out of Bounds@ for Ori, abilities nor enemies.\n2. @No glitches@ (See below). Anything not in the list is OK.\n3. @Debug controls are banned@. $Debug renderer and zoom are allowed$.\n4. DBoosting is NEVER REQUIRED for progression. This plando #can be completed hitless#.\n\n<s_1.3>Banned glitches (ongoing list)<s_1>\nAbility Swaps, Backup misuse, Buy Anywhere, Cutscene lifts, Death Warps, Dive Launch, Enemies through walls/ground,Fake Bash, Fake Burrow, Godmode, Pause Floats, QtM to warp or clip into terrain, Speedup/down jank, Wheel spam, Wavedashes (Dash + Blaze/Regen)|f=900|instant
9|0=2|4|17|9|101|1|6|<s_1.3>Rules for *BitbAem*!<s_1>\n\n1. @No Out of Bounds@ for Ori, abilities nor enemies.\n2. @No glitches@ (See below). Anything not in the list is OK.\n3. @Debug controls are banned@. $Debug renderer and zoom are allowed$.\n4. DBoosting is NEVER REQUIRED for progression. This plando #can be completed hitless#.\n5. Hard mode is very hard. You are more than welcome to ask for help :oriHug:\n\n<s_1.3>Banned glitches (ongoing list)<s_1>\nAbility Swaps, Backup misuse, Buy Anywhere, Cutscene lifts, Death Warps, Dive Launch, Enemies through walls/ground,Fake Bash, Fake Burrow, Godmode, Pause Floats, QtM to warp or clip into terrain, Speedup/down jank, Wheel spam, Wavedashes (Dash + Blaze/Regen)|f=900|instant
